入组条件:
Inclusion Criteria:

* Caucasian premenopausal women between 18-39 years with the diagnosis of endometrioma, one or more, with a diameter of up to 7 cm by endovaginal ultrasound. Body mass index comprised between 17-30 Kg/m2

Exclusion Criteria:

